          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Outcome</span><span class="info-stat-val">national prohibitions in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/canada">Canada</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/norway">Norway</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/finland">Finland</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a>, all later repealed, and prohibition in some Indian provinces from 1948 to the present; the movement still exists, with less political influence than in the early 20th century</span></div>
